{"id":"u49","kelas":"kerja","no":2,"judul":"Kehidupan Kantor dan Jabatan","title":"Office Life and Job Roles","emoji":"🏢","ringkas":"Divisi, jabatan, tugas harian, dan jadwal kerja","ready":true,"goals":["menyebut **divisi** dan **jabatan** umum di perusahaan","menjelaskan **tugas harian** memakai simple present dan kata keterangan frekuensi","membedakan simple present (rutinitas) dan present continuous (sedang dikerjakan)","menyebut **jadwal kerja**, jam kerja, dan fasilitas kantor","bertanya dan menjawab tentang pekerjaan: [[What do you do?]], [[What does your job involve?]]","membicarakan beban kerja dan prioritas dengan sopan"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Setiap kantor punya **divisi**, **jabatan**, dan **rutinitas**. Agar bisa bekerja sama, kamu perlu tahu cara menyebut siapa mengerjakan apa. Di unit ini kamu belajar kosakata kantor dan cara menjelaskan pekerjaanmu dengan jelas."},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Divisi di perusahaan","table":[["Divisi","Tugas utama","Contoh kalimat"],["**Human Resources (HR)**","merekrut dan mengurus karyawan","[[HR hires and trains new staff.]]"],["**Finance / Accounting**","anggaran, gaji, laporan keuangan","[[Finance pays the salaries.]]"],["**Marketing**","promosi dan merek","[[Marketing plans our campaigns.]]"],["**Sales**","menjual produk dan jasa","[[Sales meets the customers.]]"],["**IT**","sistem, jaringan, dukungan teknis","[[IT fixes computer problems.]]"],["**Operations**","menjalankan proses harian","[[Operations manages daily work.]]"],["**Customer Service**","melayani pelanggan","[[Customer Service answers complaints.]]"]]},{"t":"vocab","title":"2. Jabatan dan kosakata kantor","items":[{"en":"director","id":"direktur","ex":"The director leads the company."},{"en":"manager","id":"manajer","ex":"The manager approves the plan."},{"en":"team leader","id":"ketua tim","ex":"Our team leader assigns tasks."},{"en":"assistant","id":"asisten","ex":"The assistant books the meeting room."},{"en":"receptionist","id":"resepsionis","ex":"The receptionist greets visitors."},{"en":"accountant","id":"akuntan","ex":"The accountant checks the invoices."},{"en":"engineer","id":"insinyur","ex":"The engineer designs the system."},{"en":"intern","id":"peserta magang","ex":"The intern is learning fast."},{"en":"task","id":"tugas","ex":"I have three tasks today."},{"en":"deadline","id":"tenggat","ex":"The deadline is Friday."},{"en":"workload","id":"beban kerja","ex":"My workload is heavy this week."},{"en":"priority","id":"prioritas","ex":"This report is a top priority."},{"en":"shift","id":"giliran kerja","ex":"I work the morning shift."},{"en":"overtime","id":"lembur","ex":"We worked overtime last night."},{"en":"pantry","id":"pantri","ex":"Coffee is in the pantry."},{"en":"meeting room","id":"ruang rapat","ex":"The meeting room is on the second floor."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"3. Rutinitas kerja: simple present","table":[["Pola","Contoh"],["Rutinitas","[[I start work at 8 a.m. and finish at 5 p.m.]]"],["Tugas rutin","[[She answers emails every morning.]]"],["Frekuensi","[[We always have a meeting on Monday.]] / [[He sometimes works overtime.]]"],["Negatif","[[I don't work on weekends.]] / [[He doesn't attend the meeting.]]"],["Tanya","[[What time does the office open?]] / [[Do you work in shifts?]]"]]},{"t":"warn","title":"Letak kata keterangan frekuensi","text":"Kata seperti [[always]], [[usually]], [[often]], [[sometimes]], [[never]] diletakkan **sebelum kata kerja utama** tetapi **setelah to be**: [[She usually arrives early.]] / [[She is usually early.]]"},{"t":"grammar","title":"4. Present continuous untuk pekerjaan saat ini","table":[["Pola","Contoh"],["Sedang dikerjakan","[[I'm preparing the monthly report.]]"],["Proyek sementara","[[We're working on a new product this month.]]"],["Perubahan","[[The company is growing quickly.]]"],["Rencana dekat","[[I'm meeting a client tomorrow.]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"5. Bertanya tentang pekerjaan","table":[["Pertanyaan","Contoh jawaban"],["[[What do you do?]]","[[I'm an accountant.]]"],["[[What does your job involve?]]","[[It involves checking invoices and preparing reports.]]"],["[[Who do you report to?]]","[[I report to the Finance Manager.]]"],["[[What are your working hours?]]","[[I work from 8 to 5, Monday to Friday.]]"],["[[How many people are in your team?]]","[[There are six of us.]]"]]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog 1: Mengenal divisi","lines":[{"who":"Dina","en":"Tom, what does the IT department do?","id":"Tom, apa yang dikerjakan departemen IT?"},{"who":"Tom","en":"We look after the computers and the network. We also help staff when they have problems.","id":"Kami mengurus komputer dan jaringan. Kami juga membantu staf ketika mereka punya masalah."},{"who":"Dina","en":"Who do you report to?","id":"Kamu melapor kepada siapa?"},{"who":"Tom","en":"I report to the IT manager, Mr. Adi. He usually checks our tasks every morning.","id":"Aku melapor kepada manajer IT, Pak Adi. Biasanya beliau memeriksa tugas kami setiap pagi."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog 2: Beban kerja","lines":[{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"Dina, how is your workload this week?","id":"Dina, bagaimana beban kerjamu minggu ini?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"It's quite heavy. I'm preparing two reports, and the deadline is Friday.","id":"Cukup berat. Aku sedang menyiapkan dua laporan, dan tenggatnya hari Jumat."},{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"Which one is the priority?","id":"Mana yang menjadi prioritas?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"The sales report. Would it be possible to move the other one to Monday?","id":"Laporan penjualan. Apakah mungkin memindahkan yang satunya ke hari Senin?"},{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"Yes, that's fine. Let me know if you need help.","id":"Ya, tidak masalah. Beri tahu saya jika kamu butuh bantuan."}]},{"t":"tip","title":"Menjelaskan pekerjaan dengan jelas","text":"Pakai pola **jabatan + divisi + tugas utama**: [[I'm a marketing officer. I plan social media campaigns and write reports.]] Gunakan kata kerja aktif seperti [[manage]], [[prepare]], [[check]], [[organise]], [[support]]."},{"t":"summary","items":["Divisi: HR, Finance, Marketing, Sales, IT, Operations, Customer Service.","Rutinitas: **simple present** + [[always/usually/often/sometimes/never]].","Sedang dikerjakan: **present continuous** ([[I'm preparing a report.]]).","Tanya: [[What do you do?]] / [[Who do you report to?]] / [[What does your job involve?]]","Beban kerja: sebut **prioritas** dan **tenggat** dengan sopan."]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan divisi dengan tugasnya:","pairs":[["HR","merekrut karyawan"],["Finance","mengurus anggaran"],["IT","memperbaiki komputer"],["Sales","menjual produk"],["Marketing","merencanakan promosi"]],"exp":"Tugas utama divisi.","k":"346fb2c4"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kosakata dengan artinya:","pairs":[["workload","beban kerja"],["deadline","tenggat"],["overtime","lembur"],["shift","giliran kerja"]],"exp":"Kosakata kerja.","k":"86d6e1f5"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan jabatan dengan artinya:","pairs":[["receptionist","resepsionis"],["accountant","akuntan"],["intern","peserta magang"],["director","direktur"]],"exp":"Jabatan.","k":"7b6af701"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Divisi yang menangani rekrutmen adalah...","options":["HR","Finance","IT","Sales"],"answer":0,"exp":"HR mengurus karyawan.","k":"ff807ee4"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Divisi yang memperbaiki masalah komputer adalah...","options":["IT","Marketing","HR","Operations"],"answer":0,"exp":"IT.","k":"e8959ff0"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat yang benar adalah...","options":["She usually arrives early.","She arrives usually early.","She usually arrive early.","She is usually arrive early."],"answer":0,"exp":"usually sebelum kata kerja, verb-s.","k":"ef55e9f1"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat yang benar adalah...","options":["He is always on time.","He always is on time.","He is on time always.","He always are on time."],"answer":0,"exp":"Setelah to be.","k":"efd13376"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Untuk pekerjaan yang sedang dikerjakan, tense yang tepat adalah...","options":["present continuous","simple past","past perfect","future perfect"],"answer":0,"exp":"I'm preparing...","k":"21e8d5c3"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Jawaban yang tepat untuk \"Who do you report to?\" adalah...","options":["I report to the Finance Manager.","I report at eight.","I work in Finance.","Yes, I do."],"answer":0,"exp":"report to = melapor kepada.","k":"7c7b3641"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Jawaban yang tepat untuk \"What does your job involve?\" adalah...","options":["It involves preparing reports.","I live in Bandung.","At nine o'clock.","No, thanks."],"answer":0,"exp":"involve = melibatkan.","k":"bcb1331d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Cara sopan meminta menunda tugas adalah...","options":["Would it be possible to move it to Monday?","I won't do it.","Do it yourself.","Not my problem."],"answer":0,"exp":"Sopan.","k":"880c181d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang menunjukkan prioritas?","options":["This report is a top priority.","This report is blue.","This report is old.","This report is long."],"answer":0,"exp":"priority.","k":"abc03534"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya selalu mulai kerja pukul delapan.","q":"I ___ start work at 8 a.m.","answers":["always"],"hint":"selalu","exp":"always + V1.","k":"2de16fe0"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia tidak bekerja pada akhir pekan.","q":"She ___ work on weekends.","answers":["doesn't","does not"],"hint":"negatif","exp":"doesn't + V1.","k":"57f3b726"},{"type":"fill","id":"Pukul berapa kantor buka?","q":"What time ___ the office open?","answers":["does"],"hint":"does","exp":"does + V1.","k":"cc70e663"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya sedang menyiapkan laporan.","q":"I'm ___ a report. (prepare)","answers":["preparing"],"hint":"V-ing","exp":"am + V-ing.","k":"6badb7a9"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia melapor kepada manajer.","q":"She reports ___ the manager.","answers":["to"],"hint":"kepada","exp":"report to.","k":"4ce8359d"},{"type":"fill","id":"Tenggatnya hari Jumat.","q":"The ___ is Friday.","answers":["deadline"],"hint":"tenggat","exp":"deadline.","k":"995e5584"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Saya bekerja dari pukul delapan sampai lima.\"","answer":"I work from eight to five.","exp":"from ... to ...","k":"bd3868c6"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Siapa yang menjadi atasanmu?\"","answer":"Who do you report to?","exp":"Who do you report to?","k":"953fb87d"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"I am preparing the monthly report","options":["Saya sedang menyiapkan laporan bulanan","Saya menulis surat","Saya membaca laporan","Saya lupa laporan"],"answer":0,"exp":"prepare = menyiapkan.","k":"8bdd75d4"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"The deadline is Friday","options":["Tenggatnya hari Jumat","Rapat hari Jumat","Hari Jumat libur","Aku pergi hari Jumat"],"answer":0,"exp":"deadline = tenggat.","k":"48ca1e51"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia mengurus gaji karyawan.","q":"She ___ the salaries. (pay)","answers":["pays"],"hint":"he/she + s","exp":"pays.","k":"85badbd3"},{"type":"fill","id":"Tim IT memperbaiki masalah jaringan.","q":"The IT team ___ network problems. (fix)","answers":["fixes"],"hint":"he/she/it + es","exp":"fixes.","k":"49f88649"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kami mengadakan rapat setiap Senin.","q":"We ___ a meeting every Monday. (have)","answers":["have"],"hint":"have","exp":"We have.","k":"380e21c3"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia mengatur jadwal manajer.","q":"She ___ the manager's schedule. (organise)","answers":["organises","organizes"],"hint":"he/she + s","exp":"organises.","k":"a181a854"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya biasanya makan siang pukul dua belas.","q":"I ___ have lunch at 12.","answers":["usually"],"hint":"biasanya","exp":"usually.","k":"4126eeb5"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kami jarang bekerja pada hari Minggu.","q":"We ___ work on Sundays.","answers":["rarely","seldom","never"],"hint":"jarang","exp":"rarely.","k":"434bbd42"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia sedang menghadiri rapat sekarang.","q":"He is ___ a meeting now. (attend)","answers":["attending"],"hint":"V-ing","exp":"is + V-ing.","k":"3d43cad5"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya shift pagi minggu ini.","q":"I'm on the morning ___ this week.","answers":["shift"],"hint":"giliran kerja","exp":"shift.","k":"f70e6a94"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kopi ada di pantri.","q":"The coffee is in the ___.","answers":["pantry"],"hint":"pantri","exp":"pantry.","k":"0d1ce674"},{"type":"fill","id":"Ruang rapat ada di lantai dua.","q":"The meeting room is on the second ___.","answers":["floor"],"hint":"lantai","exp":"floor.","k":"e1db0467"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia melapor kepada direktur.","q":"He ___ to the director. (report)","answers":["reports"],"hint":"he + s","exp":"reports to.","k":"b23057a6"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Siapa yang memimpin sebuah tim kecil?","options":["team leader","intern","receptionist","driver"],"answer":0,"exp":"team leader.","k":"ae85d2fd"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Siapa yang masih belajar di perusahaan?","options":["intern","director","manager","accountant"],"answer":0,"exp":"intern = magang.","k":"2ba3425d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Divisi mana yang membuat kampanye iklan?","options":["Marketing","Finance","IT","HR"],"answer":0,"exp":"Marketing.","k":"6052b318"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Divisi mana yang menjawab keluhan pelanggan?","options":["Customer Service","Finance","Legal","Security"],"answer":0,"exp":"Customer Service.","k":"0f4f41b4"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang benar?","options":["He doesn't attend the meeting.","He don't attend the meeting.","He not attend the meeting.","He doesn't attends the meeting."],"answer":0,"exp":"doesn't + V1.","k":"6a283b85"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang benar?","options":["Does she work in shifts?","Do she work in shifts?","Does she works in shifts?","She does work in shift?"],"answer":0,"exp":"Does + subjek + V1.","k":"0159da3f"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang benar?","options":["I'm working on a new project this month.","I work on a new project this month now.","I am work on a new project.","I working on a new project."],"answer":0,"exp":"am + V-ing.","k":"49fd44bb"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang menunjukkan perubahan?","options":["The company is growing quickly.","The company grows.","The company grew.","The company has grown."],"answer":0,"exp":"present continuous untuk tren.","k":"5d76819c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Jawaban sopan jika beban kerja berat adalah...","options":["I have a heavy workload. Could we adjust the deadline?","I'm tired of you.","I won't work.","No."],"answer":0,"exp":"Sopan.","k":"26cb21d1"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata \"assign\" artinya...","options":["menugaskan","menolak","membeli","menunda"],"answer":0,"exp":"assign.","k":"afa0fe90"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata \"approve\" artinya...","options":["menyetujui","menolak","melupakan","menulis"],"answer":0,"exp":"approve.","k":"7c45cd83"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata \"support\" dalam \"IT supports staff\" artinya...","options":["mendukung / membantu","menghentikan","menyalin","membayar"],"answer":0,"exp":"support.","k":"1b40e976"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Kami selalu mengadakan rapat hari Senin.\"","answer":"We always have a meeting on Monday.","exp":"always sebelum V.","k":"76ae0760"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan jabatan dengan tugas:","pairs":[["accountant","memeriksa faktur"],["receptionist","menyapa tamu"],["engineer","merancang sistem"],["assistant","memesan ruang rapat"]],"exp":"Tugas jabatan.","k":"1da1cb2e"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"I usually start work at eight","options":["Saya biasanya mulai kerja pukul delapan","Saya selesai pukul delapan","Saya tidak bekerja","Saya tiba pukul sembilan"],"answer":0,"exp":"usually.","k":"230ff724"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Our team leader assigns the tasks","options":["Ketua tim kami membagi tugas","Kami menolak tugas","Tim kami pergi","Ketua kami libur"],"answer":0,"exp":"assign.","k":"a5061624"}],"quiz":[{"type":"mcq","q":"Siapa yang menyapa tamu di kantor?","options":["receptionist","accountant","engineer","intern"],"answer":0,"exp":"Resepsionis.","k":"cf20589b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Frasa \"work overtime\" artinya...","options":["bekerja lembur","bekerja pagi","bekerja sendiri","tidak bekerja"],"answer":0,"exp":"overtime = lembur.","k":"602da797"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat yang benar adalah...","options":["We never work on Sundays.","We work never on Sundays.","We never works on Sundays.","We are never work on Sundays."],"answer":0,"exp":"never sebelum kata kerja.","k":"ce1183ff"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang present continuous?","options":["We're working on a new product this month.","We work on new products.","We worked on a product.","We will work on a product."],"answer":0,"exp":"are + V-ing.","k":"ceeb947c"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia sering bekerja lembur.","q":"He ___ works overtime.","answers":["often","sometimes","usually"],"hint":"sering","exp":"frekuensi.","k":"4d667e79"},{"type":"fill","id":"Berapa orang di timmu?","q":"How many people ___ in your team?","answers":["are"],"hint":"are","exp":"How many people are ...","k":"4a4900a5"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Saya bertanggung jawab atas laporan keuangan.\"","answer":"I am responsible for the financial reports.","exp":"responsible for.","k":"a8ecc1be"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan pertanyaan dengan jawaban:","pairs":[["What do you do?","I'm an engineer."],["Who do you report to?","To the manager."],["What are your hours?","8 to 5."],["Where is the pantry?","Next to the lift."]],"exp":"Tanya jawab pekerjaan.","k":"ffd621fe"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Who do you report to","options":["Kamu melapor kepada siapa","Kamu bekerja di mana","Kapan kamu mulai","Apa pekerjaanmu"],"answer":0,"exp":"report to.","k":"7a353b87"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mengapa perlu menyebut prioritas kepada atasan?","options":["agar pekerjaan penting selesai dulu","agar pekerjaan bertambah","agar rapat lebih lama","agar tidak perlu kerja"],"answer":0,"exp":"Prioritas membantu pengaturan kerja.","k":"b887135f"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang menyatakan rencana dekat?","options":["I'm meeting a client tomorrow.","I met a client yesterday.","I meet clients.","I have met a client."],"answer":0,"exp":"present continuous untuk rencana.","k":"108b252b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Divisi Finance menangani...","options":["anggaran dan gaji","iklan","jaringan","pelayanan pelanggan"],"answer":0,"exp":"Finance.","k":"c31f9fca"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia bekerja shift malam.","q":"She works the night ___.","answers":["shift"],"hint":"shift","exp":"shift.","k":"885db34d"},{"type":"fill","id":"Beban kerjaku berat.","q":"My ___ is heavy.","answers":["workload"],"hint":"beban kerja","exp":"workload.","k":"673d7dd9"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kami sedang mengerjakan proyek baru.","q":"We are ___ on a new project.","answers":["working"],"hint":"V-ing","exp":"working on.","k":"19d9d2ca"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang menanyakan jam kerja?","options":["What are your working hours?","Where do you live?","Who is your friend?","How old are you?"],"answer":0,"exp":"working hours.","k":"130725c9"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang menyatakan kebiasaan?","options":["He often works overtime.","He is working now.","He worked yesterday.","He will work."],"answer":0,"exp":"often.","k":"7243718e"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang menyatakan sedang terjadi?","options":["I'm writing a report now.","I write reports.","I wrote a report.","I have written reports."],"answer":0,"exp":"now.","k":"c77a0dc2"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"There are six of us in the team\" artinya...","options":["ada enam orang di tim kami","kami berenam pergi","enam tim","tim kami hilang"],"answer":0,"exp":"six of us.","k":"61762409"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Divisi mana yang mengatur laporan keuangan?","options":["Finance","Marketing","Security","Legal"],"answer":0,"exp":"Finance.","k":"356b3d41"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Dia melapor kepada manajer IT.\"","answer":"She reports to the IT manager.","exp":"reports to.","k":"f7dfe6e6"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan frekuensi dengan artinya:","pairs":[["always","selalu"],["often","sering"],["sometimes","kadang-kadang"],["never","tidak pernah"]],"exp":"Frekuensi.","k":"71e23387"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"We worked overtime last night","options":["Kami lembur tadi malam","Kami pulang cepat","Kami libur","Kami tidur lama"],"answer":0,"exp":"overtime.","k":"d299f1b5"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mengapa menggunakan kata kerja aktif saat menjelaskan tugas?","options":["agar jelas dan singkat","agar lebih panjang","agar bingung","agar sopan"],"answer":0,"exp":"Kata kerja aktif lebih jelas.","k":"a2c076f5"}]}